WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Start the mesh fixture with its embedded admin CLI.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
narrator: These commands manage control-plane users and keys, not traffic purchases.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:14.000
narrator: Create Alice and inspect the command result.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:24.000
narrator: List users before choosing the target user for a key.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:35.000
narrator: The key command requests user ID one; check that user's identity.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:48.000
narrator: List nodes registered with the fixture.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.000
narrator: Remove the local mesh.
